        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[How to Paint an Ork Boy | Warhammer 40,000 | Armageddon]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/5fojqola/how-to-paint-an-ork-boy-warhammer-40000-armageddon</link>
            <guid>5fojqola</guid>
            <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Boyz charge forward in large, tide-like mobs led by hulking Boss Nobs. Laying down hails of inaccurate, but enthusiastic, dakka, they dash towards the enemy before hurling themselves into close-quarters combat, where their sheer muscles, ferocity and vicious choppas help them make short work of the foe. In this video, Ollie shows you how to paint one in the colours of the Goff Clan.]]></description>
